compiler/rt/native/fmt_flt.ail implements published methods, written
directly in AIL with no code taken from other projects: Schubfach (Raffaello
Giulietti, "The Schubfach way to render doubles", 2020) for the shortest
digits of a float, and the Eisel-Lemire method (Daniel Lemire, "Number
Parsing at a Gigabyte per Second", 2021) for text to float. Its table of
powers of ten is generated by tools/native/gen_pow10.py.

